Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.75,0:02:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! He's not holding back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.58,0:02:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta move!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.21,0:02:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything here is done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.80,0:02:14.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So, that's where those detestable Shandorian\Nwarriors have hidden their village.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.97,0:02:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're originally from the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.51,0:02:21.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surely they would love to go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, fall to the world below!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our village, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.91,0:02:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That could've been us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we had waited any longer,\Nwe'd be ashes.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.74,0:02:57.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,In the name of Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.12,0:03:15.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.36,0:03:20.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Your distant ancestor had many reasons\Nfor wanting to take back our homeland.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.42,0:03:22.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But one you may not know.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He had another reason?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.17,0:03:26.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It would become his greatest regret.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.97,0:03:35.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara\Nhad a very close friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.64,0:03:37.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara had a friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.98,0:03:45.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He came to know Kalgara 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.78,0:03:50.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,His name... Mont Blanc Noland!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.87,0:04:03.50,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The following tale took place long,\Nlong ago... some 400 years in the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.34,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,And though it was never written down,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.31,0:04:10.52,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,it has remained in people's hearts\Nfrom one generation to the next.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back to the ship, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.23,0:04:18.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The monster of\NShandora is right behind us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.15,0:04:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Cast off! Cast off!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.48,0:04:22.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Captain, there are still crewmen...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just get us out to sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you'll face my wrath!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave your possessions.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.79,0:05:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Flee with your lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.01,0:05:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir! The daily report!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.97,0:05:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to inform you that we've\Nreached the end of our food supply.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.47,0:05:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meaning, of course,\Nwe are now lost at sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.62,0:05:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And will... slowly... die.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.49,0:05:25.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cook fainted!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! No more food!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like the commodore\Nfell into the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.17,0:05:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.54,0:05:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he decide to drown himself\Nand leave us to our fates?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe he decided on a\Nquick death over starvation.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.35,0:05:40.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!\NThe commodore is a great man!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.73,0:05:43.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's already returned\Ntwice from these waters!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.19,0:05:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! What are these carefully\Nfolded clothes and shoes here for?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone go check.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This sea is chock full of monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not coming up.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.89,0:05:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.64,0:05:58.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was a crafty one.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's the rope for?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haul it in, boys.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What is that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore, did you\Nkill that beast underwater?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.10,0:06:12.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cook it up for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.93,0:06:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been gettin' lazy. Man.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Must be losin' my touch.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.74,0:06:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This storm's a real whopper, Commodore!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've been through worse.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? How does that help us?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.73,0:06:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The yardarm's been broken off!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.81,0:06:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.60,0:06:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Main! Main!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.85,0:06:36.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This third voyage has kept\Nus at sea for over two years.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's a miracle\Nwe've lasted this long.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, did anybody else hear that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear what? You mean the thunder?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it's something else.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.73,0:06:51.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something beautiful, like a bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.63,0:06:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Priest! Are you certain of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.05,0:06:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land is cursed!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.05,0:07:02.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Shandorians\Nwill be wiped out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.27,0:07:05.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then what can we\Ndo to save the village, Priest?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.72,0:07:08.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must offer another girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.15,0:07:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At the sacrificial altar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too much death. How many now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.22,0:07:27.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well over a hundred.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.93,0:07:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing like this\Nhas ever happened to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.31,0:07:40.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I can help save the village,\Nthen I will gladly sacrifice my life.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you cry? Mother.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.85,0:07:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It is truly an honor to be chosen as\Nsacrifice and embraced by the Sun God.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.27,0:07:56.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Today is a proud and happy day for me,\Nand it should be for you as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.54,0:08:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for raising\Nme right these many years, Mama.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mousse!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.30,0:08:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If this is a bad dream, let me wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.80,0:08:17.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get off of me! Get off!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.07,0:08:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.99,0:08:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to grow up\Nto be just like you someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.59,0:08:34.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a brave warrior\Nand fight to protect this land!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die from\Nsomething like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Commodore!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.33,0:08:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We took the heading you said to,\Nand sure enough, there's an island!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, how fortunate.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.75,0:08:57.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can ride out the storm here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still, you sure none\Nof you guys heard it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.36,0:09:00.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.65,0:09:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of us heard any bells.\NIsn't that right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must've been hearing\Nthings, Commodore.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.23,0:09:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's quite a forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.58,0:09:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope we find\Nstuff to help our research.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Commodore! There's your bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.49,0:09:30.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, enough, boys.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No need to tease.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd mistake\Nthat freak bird call for a bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, Commodore. Did you...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.37,0:10:04.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's unreal.\NIt has such a beautiful tone.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems there are people here after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Commodore, slow down! Wait for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone's collapsed over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Intruders.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.68,0:10:25.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You there!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.01,0:10:26.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.51,0:10:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look right!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.70,0:10:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a plague called "tree fever."
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.97,0:10:40.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From the looks of him,\Nhe hasn't been treated.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for? Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor, check our Conine stores.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Administer doses to this young\Nman and the crew immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.55,0:10:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.05,0:10:57.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the crops are being eaten away.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore!\NThe whole village is infected!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.24,0:11:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring the girl to the altar!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God of the sun!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.41,0:11:24.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God of the rain!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God of the forest!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.13,0:11:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God of the earth!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.04,0:11:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In exchange for this girl's\Nlife, we beseech you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spare our village!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.44,0:11:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the Kashi God!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mousse!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For the village. Let her go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.36,0:12:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Kashi God.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such a divine form!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please save my mother.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.12,0:12:11.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please save my son.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And spare my father.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that? Something fell in!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fell in?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.20,0:12:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kashi, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's killed a God!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.54,0:12:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ceremony is over.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.67,0:12:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must've been frightened.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're safe now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no need to die.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.13,0:13:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kashi, please forgive us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're all going to be cursed!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill them both!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.35,0:13:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Offer the gods more lives\Nbefore we incur their wrath!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.21,0:13:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kalgara! Kill them!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.05,0:13:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The commodore's\Ngone and done it this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They sound really mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.51,0:13:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy can't just keep to himself!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.09,0:13:18.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He killed a god?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.09,0:13:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tribal rituals ain't\Nsomething you mess around with!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.59,0:13:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quell the gods'\Nanger, Great Warrior Kalgara!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am an explorer from the North Blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore Mont Blanc Nol...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are, outsider!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.58,0:13:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be eliminated!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.78,0:13:37.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eliminated? Is that your answer?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.74,0:13:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just destroy all\Nmanner of progress?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.46,0:13:42.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no right\Nto impose your values!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now. Say goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's holding his own against Kalgara!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.51,0:13:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.76,0:13:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Use that blade to give\Nyour life to the gods!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.82,0:14:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.95,0:14:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}A sacrifice meant to save the entire village,\Nweeping because she wants to live?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.37,0:14:08.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Disgraceful!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.21,0:14:16.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.44,0:14:43.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For centuries, our people have strictly\Nupheld the sacred commandment...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that all intruders on\Nthis island must be punished.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.79,0:14:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And you have commited the unforgivable\Nsin of slaughtering Kashi.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You alone cannot atone for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.28,0:14:54.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and all your men\Nwill pay with your lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Sacrifices" this.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Lives" that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.55,0:14:58.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.76,0:15:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How does that make your gods happy?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.10,0:15:06.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}These ceremonies are flat-out denials\Nof the triumphs of all great men before us.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.14,0:15:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.19,0:15:11.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You insult every\Nadventurer and researcher
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.02,0:15:15.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who's ever set out to sea in hopes\Nof bringing prosperity to mankind!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How shameful!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.40,0:15:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If your gods value your lives,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.19,0:15:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,wouldn't they have contempt\Nfor these very ceremonies?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give me some time, people.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.36,0:15:34.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your so-called curse?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will lift it for good.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if I cannot...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.91,0:15:40.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may do what you\Nwill with my crew and I.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.32,0:15:44.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What nonsense!\NDo you think you're a god?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.99,0:15:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And in return...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.69,0:15:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I do save this\Nvillage from tragedy...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.50,0:15:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must swear never to\Nperform this ceremony again!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.40,0:15:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.88,0:16:01.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous! Now prepare to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let him try!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.88,0:16:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will have until sundown tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.51,0:16:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When your crew will die.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I accept your terms.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.85,0:16:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, fellas, come sunset tomorrow,\Nit looks like it's "goodbye world" for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.53,0:16:24.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have faith in the commodore.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.68,0:16:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, pretty lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.10,0:16:30.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you too.\NIt's a shame you were born here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah! With your looks, you could've married\Nan aristocrat and lived the good life!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Learn a little tact!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.77,0:16:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.31,0:16:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who? You mean the commodore?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name is Mont Blanc Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a rather famous explorer.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's also a skilled botanist.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.89,0:16:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He explores uncharted islands and documents\Nnew species of plants for his research.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.85,0:16:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's pretty much a hero in our country.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he's way too nice a guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.74,0:17:01.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's impossible for him\Nto ignore a situation like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.09,0:17:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know we can trust him though!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.38,0:17:08.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did you not\Nlet Kalgara kill him right then?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The answer will\Nmake itself known tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.72,0:17:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He says he can save our village.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no harm in waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.89,0:17:22.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll listen to him,\Nbut not the shaman's dying words?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.48,0:17:25.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalgara! Please say something\Nabout this outrage!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.57,0:17:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I sense that the village is\Nin even the slightest danger,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.28,0:17:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not hesitate to take that\Nman's head before sunset tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.95,0:17:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may not have the power\Nto hear the words of the gods.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.95,0:17:38.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.54,0:17:44.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can hear the words of a man\Nwho speaks in earnest.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.28,0:17:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, that is all.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.51,0:17:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.06,0:17:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing awake?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.05,0:17:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm all better.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.93,0:17:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.77,0:18:02.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did he mean? By "progress?"
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here we are! A Cona tree!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew there had to be one.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In a forest this huge?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Earthquake!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kashi's wrath has finally come!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let us out of here, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such devastation.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.54,0:18:51.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The forest floor has sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks as if the island\Nis tearing itself apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're looking well.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.18,0:19:10.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I suppose the gods have taken your\Npunishment into their own divine hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.77,0:19:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then your gods... have grown weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.69,0:19:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They lack... the strength\Nto kill even one lowly explorer.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stubborn fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.53,0:19:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but would you mind leaving?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like looking at you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.69,0:19:36.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to... hurry to the village.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.09,0:19:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll enjoy watching this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and squirm!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.98,0:19:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Another warrior has died.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there was that terrible earthquake.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.12,0:19:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are the evil spirits!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we will punish you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.57,0:20:00.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This wasn't the agreement!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.56,0:20:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Look out!\N– Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.75,0:20:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seto! Move aside!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.83,0:20:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.00,0:20:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Shandoran warriors\NI know and look up to...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.84,0:20:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They show a lot more pride than you do.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.09,0:20:21.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kid...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.90,0:20:23.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.86,0:20:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should prepare yourself\Nfor when the sun sets.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.33,0:20:32.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's when the lives of your men...\Nwill be an offering... unto the gods.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.51,0:20:41.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.56,0:20:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.90,0:20:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The earth certainly did\Nswallow you up skillfully.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.90,0:20:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was truly an act of god!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.07,0:20:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're still alive\Nis what's hardest to believe!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the ceremony!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.59,0:21:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring every sacrifice to the altar!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.47,0:21:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, wait a little longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.10,0:21:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The commodore'll\Nbe back in a few more hours!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.31,0:21:30.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give us more time! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.93,0:21:32.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing this to us?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.90,0:21:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sun is setting.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ceremony must be starting soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How disgusting.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.63,0:21:48.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this the wreck of a man\Nwho defied the gods?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.30,0:21:51.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.31,0:21:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Afraid?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.01,0:21:53.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fear what you do not know!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.55,0:21:58.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you trade innocent people's\Nlives for false consolations!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.39,0:22:00.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.60,0:22:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sacrifices... are pointless deaths!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.37,0:22:12.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have lived this way for centuries!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make it right!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.09,0:22:17.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.55,0:22:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know what\Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.66,0:22:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The lives of your citizens\Nare more precious than gods.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.60,0:22:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're real people!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take the sacrifices to the altar!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.42,0:22:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burn them at the stake and\Nsend them to the Heavens!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.88,0:22:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore! Don't let them burn us!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.53,0:22:53.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can send an\Ninnocent girl to her death.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.56,0:22:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And have no remorse, so I doubt\Nyou'd understand, but try.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.64,0:22:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What you're doing is less than human!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.85,0:23:01.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.61,0:23:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No remorse, you say.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.88,0:23:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The innocent girl you speak of.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.83,0:23:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She was my daughter!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.82,0:23:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.52,0:23:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You would tell your own\Ndaughter to give up her life?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're very wrong.\NAnd you don't understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.31,0:23:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is so much power\Nin the words of our gods.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.02,0:23:29.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the people must obey.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The gods will not hear our pleas!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.53,0:23:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we ask them\Nto spare our children.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.92,0:23:44.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than the last one.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.67,0:23:47.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be one of Kashi's children!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.86,0:23:51.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The gods' blood has come\Nto pass judgment on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Judgment my ass!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.49,0:23:57.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.82,0:23:59.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tree Fever is a plague.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.28,0:24:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A plague that wiped out\Nhundreds of thousands of lives
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.71,0:24:04.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in my own village years ago\Nand now it is ravaging yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.88,0:24:06.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.05,0:24:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one's died in decades as a result\Nof this awful disease. No one!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.74,0:24:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.89,0:24:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because we discovered a cure for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.06,0:24:22.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm holding in my hand\Nbark from the Cona tree.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.25,0:24:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the cure!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.67,0:24:27.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only need to extract\Nthe Conine from it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.67,0:24:32.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I can bring this back to your people,\NI can save all of their lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.60,0:24:39.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you insist on keeping\Ncountless masses from their cure.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.44,0:24:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do you realize how many innocent victims\Nhave already perished because of you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.90,0:24:46.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I stand by what I said.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.94,0:24:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ceremonies are\Nan insult to my people.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.24,0:24:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're too busy blindly trampling over
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.49,0:24:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,great advancements to see how\Nmuch it could benefit you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.31,0:25:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may die in judgment,\Nor I may die in an accident.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.25,0:25:03.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least I'll stay true to my people.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.25,0:25:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How will your village die,\Nby ignorance?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.83,0:25:11.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the pain you cause your people\Nworth it to be true to your Gods?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.84,0:25:17.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a man who speaks earnest words.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.79,0:25:18.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I recognize that.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.38,0:25:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Answer this.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.80,0:25:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.22,0:25:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What have I killed?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.38,0:25:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– A snake.\N– No!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.72,0:25:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.52,0:25:36.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just broke one of our commandments!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.68,0:25:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just killed a precious god!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.18,0:25:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A god! Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.69,0:25:51.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But all you can see is a snake!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.06,0:25:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you see our deadly curse\Nas some curable disease!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.40,0:25:56.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Can you save our village?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.70,0:25:59.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can.
